        <head>WOMEN'S CHAT.</head>
        <p>WOMEN'S CHAT.</p>
        <p>ASSOCIATION FOOTBALL.</p>
        <p>WARRINGTON AND DISTRICT LEAGUE. FIRST DIVISION.</p>
        <p>47 13 34 21 - 30 41 19 19 20 30 29 23 29 15 38 12 41</p>
        <p>„ Result 28th April. Oughtrington Park 4, Castner Kellner 1. Result April 30th. Deciding Match. Gughtrington Park 4, Warrington Albions I. W.-ARI:INGTON ELEMENTARY SCHOOLS LEAGUE.</p>
        <p>Things that</p>
        <p>make</p>
        <p>life easier</p>
        <p>It used to be thought impossible to speak' to people hundreds of miles away or ,to wash clothes without boiling them..</p>
        <p>That was before the telephone and Fels-Napa.</p>
        <p>Now you can do both. ,</p>
        <p>But you can't do the talking by shouting or the washing with ordinary ,soaps. You must use the telephone in the one case and Fels--I'.;aptila soap in the other.</p>
        <p>Modern science is making life easier</p>
        <p>for both</p>
        <p>men and women.</p>
        <p>FELS-NAPTHA 39 Wilson Street London EC</p>
