        <p>WHO ARE THE OTHER Fourt ? Mr. Andrew Carnegie speaking at a complimentary banquet a.t. Ottawa to the Canadian Premier on Saturday declared that Sir Wilfrid Laurier was one of the five greatest men in the world.</p>
