        <p>widen the passage adjoining the Royal Court Theatre to 20 feet. - Alderman BENNETT, in moving the adoption of the minutes, referred to the 20-feet passage, and said he thought it extremely short-sighted policy not to have had the 40-feet street. I Councillor EVANS seconded. I Councillor LORD asked if any property purchased I without the sanction of the Council was included in the 'sum of £lB4O (accounts recommended for payment). The DsPorY TOWN CLERK :—I don't think there is. We cannot say off-hand. Councillor PEMBERTON : I want to know too. After looking up the matter, it was stated that there was no item for property purchased in the accounts for the month.</p>
        <p>The New Street.</p>
