        <p>This preparation is unquestionably one of the most genuine and reliable Patent Medicines ever introduced, and has we ,understand, been tised in the Continental Hospitals by [Mord, Rostan, Jobert. Velpeau, Malsonnenve the well- known Classeaignac, and indeed by all who are regarded as authorities in such matters, including the celebrated Lal'emend. end Bowe, by whom it was some time since uniformly adopted.and that it Is worthy the attention of those who require such a remedy we think there Is no doubt. From the time of Aristotle downwards a potent agent in the removal of these diseases has (like the famed philosopher's stone) been the object of search of some hopeful generous minds.; and far beyond the mere power—if such could ever have been discovered —of transmuting the baser metals into gold is surely the discovery of a remedy so potent as to re- plenish the fatting energies in the one ease, and in the other so effectually. speedi)y and safely to expel horn the system the poisons of acquired or inherited disease in all their potent forms as to leave no taint or trace behind. Such is the new French Remedy THIIRAPION, which may certainly rank with, if not take precedence of, many of the discoveries of our day, about which no ;little ostentation cud noise hays been made, and the extensive and ever-increasing demand that has been created for this medicine wherever introduced appears to nrove that it Is destined to cast Into oblivion all those questionable remedies that were formerly the sole reliance of medical men. Therapion may be obtained of the principal chemists and merchants throughout the world.— Diamond _Fields Advertiser."—Kimberley.—lkr. partteluare Of lherapiOn, send stamped, addressed envelope to MIL R. JOHNSON, 43, HOLFORD SQ., LONDON, CV•O.</p>
