        <p>PR3PERTY PU11111;1311a.</p>
        <p>SECRECY OBJECTED TO AT.THE COUNCIL MEETING.</p>
        <p>_ Councillor Pentherton's Motion Carried. The conditions governing the purchase of property by the Corporation were under discussion at the meet- ing of the Warrington Town Council on Tuesday even- ing.in the first place Councillor Lord asked the Chairman of the Street Improvement and Lighting Committee: 1. Has an agreement been entered into on behalf of the Warrington Corporation for the purchase of John Edelsten and Son's Pin Mill, Knutsford-road ? 2. If so, what is the date of the agreement runt the price tweed to be paid? 3. What properties have been purchased without the saction of the Local Government Board, and what amount has been paid for the same? THE ANEW Alderman Bennett's replies were: 1. Yes.</p>
