        <head>LIST OF NEW MEMBERS.</head>
        <p>LIST OF NEW MEMBERS.</p>
        <p>Dick Ayrton, Maggie Ayrton, Ernest W. Howarth, Dick Trickett, Fred Greenwood, Mark Stott, Arthur Stcdt, Joe Eastwood, Torn East- wood, James Ireland, Maggie Ireland, Jack Linsay, William Linsay, Dick Unsay, Harry Balour, Walter Balour William Lane, Annie Lane, Dick Pollard, Fred Pollard, Nellie Earns- bottom, Fred Jones, Arnojd Bolton, Albert Bolton, John Kay, Walter &amp;bit, Pater Ormerod, Fred Bothwell, William• Bentley, Edward Bentley, Joe Barnes, Maggie' Barnes, Walter Barnes., Annie Barnes, Eldie Wright, John Grime, Dick Barks, Doris Barks, Varry King, Willie King,.liargld Nuttall, Lily Hindle, Henry Fielding, Edward Holland, Joe Estwood, Dick Estwood, John Barnes, Edith Flodsclon, Alice Brunt, Edith and Rose Roberts, Flossie Garra- way, Winifred Martin, Alice Platt, May Stott, Maggie Kirby, James Riley, Joe Holden, Ipora stott, Alice Barnes, Maria Pilling, Sarah Barlow, Lizzie Riley, Anice Riley, Doris Parkes, Willie John " Riley, Florence Mercy, Mary Ingham, Florence Hoyle, Emma Wilcock, Lizzie Riley, Lizzie J. Pilling; Alice, Heap, Mary E. Holden, Nellie Ramebotted, Fred Pilling, Edward</p>
