      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1906-05-05_WidnesExaminer_art0089" n="art0089">
        <head>Proposcd New Police Staticn.</head>
        <p>Proposcd New Police Staticn.</p>
        <p>TRE DUST PROBLEM.</p>
        <p>Several matters of interest were under consideration at a meeting of the Great Sankey Parish Council held in the Cornell Schools on INonasy evening. Mr. G. hompson presided and there were also present:— Messrs. W. Furners H. Faitclosgh, G. Higgs, A. Birch and J. Smith (dell). _ -</p>
