      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1906-05-05_WidnesExaminer_art0093" n="art0093">
        <head>Examiner, Faturcia,y, May 5, 1906. SCIENCE NOTES AND NEWS.</head>
        <p>The Examiner, Faturcia,y, May 5, 1906. SCIENCE NOTES AND NEWS.</p>
        <p>PRETTY are not pretty by accident. Send 3 etamp e for samples of Bates' Polleta, th, wonderful heautilior. linab,es the INOMEN wO,l 0 to eomnul'e with tt .d.—filres, 30,</p>
