        <p>TEA TIME TALK.</p>
        <p>Currant bread, either alone o with butte, is just t he thing for tea time. Besides being the most suitable thing to take with the cup that cheers, it is full of nourishment in a delicions form. Its,clst is trifling, ad your baker will supply you regularly with White .and Hovis currant bread.</p>
