        <head>LOCAL WEDDING.</head>
        <p>LOCAL WEDDING.</p>
        <p>Mounfield—Ford.</p>
        <p>An interesting wedding was solemnized at Wycliffe Congregational Church on Tuesday afternoon, the contracting parties being Mr. G. S. Monnfield, Man- chester-road, and Miss Helena Ford, daughter of Mr. W. Ford, of Froghall-lane. There was a large attend- ance at the church to witness the ceremony which was performed by the Rev. John Yonge. Mr. C. J. Moun- field acted as best man, and the bridesmaids were Miss E. Mountield and Miss K. Ford. After the ,wedclino; the party adjourned to Wycliffe Memorial Hall, where the wedding breakfast was served, the caterer being Mrs. Atkinson. The following is a list of the presents : Bride to bridegroom, inkstand -- to writing-case</p>
